  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Pinterest 收藏 · DeepSeek Harness 插件",
      "text": "<p>\n  <a href=\"packages/plugin/README.md\">插件文档(中文)</a> ·\n  <a href=\"packages/plugin/README.en.md\">English</a> ·\n  <a href=\"packages/website/README.md\">官网文档</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://pinterestcollect.pages.dev/\">官网 ↗</a>\n</p>\n\n> 一个把 Pinterest 收藏夹和个性化推荐流放进 DeepSeek Harness 的面板插件;附带一个零构建的官网。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/screenshots/plugin-overview.webp\" alt=\"Pinterest 收藏插件界面:左侧是收藏夹,右侧是 Pinterest 个性化推荐流\" width=\"100%\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>左侧收藏 · 右侧个性化推荐流 · 看到喜欢的图点 ♥ 即收藏</sub></p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "仓库结构(monorepo)",
      "text": "| 位置 | 说明 | 文档 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 仓库根(包名 `pinterest-collect`) | **安装入口**:`dsh.bundle` / `dsh.client` 声明、bundle patch 与模块导出 | 本 README |\n| [`packages/plugin`](packages/plugin) | **插件源码**:左侧本地收藏夹、右侧 Pinterest 浏览与登录推荐流、账号页、设置页 | [中文](packages/plugin/README.md) · [English](packages/plugin/README.en.md) · [契约](packages/plugin/CONTRACT.md) |\n| [`packages/website`](packages/website) | **官网**:纯静态、中英双语、响应式、内置 SEO(OG / hreflang / JSON-LD / sitemap) | [website/README.md](packages/website/README.md) |\n| [`docs/`](docs) | README 截图等静态资源 | — |"
    },
    {
      "section": "仓库结构(monorepo)",
      "text": "```\npinterest-collect/\n├─ packages/\n│  ├─ plugin/        # 插件源码\n│  └─ website/       # 静态官网"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装插件",
      "text": "仓库根就是可安装的 bundle 入口(`package.json` 声明 `dsh.bundle` / `dsh.client`,模块导出指向 `packages/plugin`)。可以直接从 GitHub 安装:\n\n```text\nplugin_manager {\n  action: \"install_bundle\",\n  target: \"github:extrastu/pinterest-collect\"\n}\n\n本地开发时指向仓库绝对路径也一样(不要指向 `packages/plugin`,那是源码包,没有声明 bundle):\n\n```text\nplugin_manager {\n  action: \"install_bundle\",\n  target: \"/absolute/path/to/pinterest-collect\"\n}\n\n然后重启一次 Harness 并刷新页面,侧边栏会出现「Pinterest 收藏」图标。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装插件",
      "text": "> monorepo 布局:安装入口在**仓库根**,插件实现在 `packages/plugin`,官网在 `packages/website`。\n> 详细安装、登录、使用与排错见 [packages/plugin/README.md](packages/plugin/README.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "官网",
      "text": "线上地址:**https://pinterestcollect.pages.dev/**(英文 `/en/`,Cloudflare Pages 部署)。\n\n本地预览:\n\n```bash\npython3 -m http.server 8080 --directory packages/website\n```\n\n打开 http://localhost:8080。部署说明见 [packages/website/README.md](packages/website/README.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "需要 Node.js ≥ 22(pnpm 可选,只用于 workspace 管理)。\n\n```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "可选:让 pnpm 识别 workspace",
      "text": "pnpm install\n\npnpm build          # 重新生成 packages/plugin/client.js\npnpm test           # Host 路由 + 抓取客户端测试\npnpm test:login     # Chrome 登录管道 + 两段式登录测试(headless)\npnpm check          # 安装 / 接口 / 静态合规检查\npnpm serve:website  # 本地预览官网\n```\n\n也可以直接调用脚本:\n\n```bash\nnode packages/plugin/build-client.mjs\nnode packages/plugin/tools/host-api-test.mjs\nnode packages/plugin/tools/verify/check.mjs\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "可选:让 pnpm 识别 workspace",
      "text": "约定:客户端是普通 JS 片段(无 JSX)、颜色只用主题 token、文案走 `pcT`、新增文案要补英文词典——详见 [packages/plugin/CONTRACT.md](packages/plugin/CONTRACT.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "相关 App",
      "text": "[Post Saver](https://apps.apple.com/app/apple-store/id6816399878?pt=128665559&ct=pinterest-collect&mt=8)——在 iPhone / iPad 上保存 23 个平台的帖子。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "本项目采用 [MIT License](LICENSE)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "免责声明",
      "text": "非官方第三方插件,与 Pinterest 无关联。插件通过 Pinterest Web 接口读取数据,可能受其服务条款约束,请用于个人自用并自行承担账号风控等风险。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Pinterest Collection · DeepSeek Harness plugin",
      "text": "<p>\n  <a href=\"packages/plugin/README.en.md\">Plugin docs (English)</a> ·\n  <a href=\"packages/plugin/README.md\">中文</a> ·\n  <a href=\"packages/website/README.md\">Website docs</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://pinterestcollect.pages.dev/\">Live site ↗</a>\n</p>\n\n> A DeepSeek Harness panel plugin that puts your Pinterest saves and personalized feed inside the harness, plus a zero-build marketing site."
    },
    {
      "section": "Pinterest Collection · DeepSeek Harness plugin",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/screenshots/plugin-overview.webp\" alt=\"Pinterest Collection plugin UI: your saves on the left, the personalized Pinterest feed on the right\" width=\"100%\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>Your saves on the left · a personalized feed on the right · hit ♥ to save</sub></p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Monorepo layout",
      "text": "| Location | What it is | Docs |\n|---|---|---|\n| Repository root (package `pinterest-collect`) | **Install entry**: `dsh.bundle` / `dsh.client` declarations, bundle patch and module exports | this README |\n| [`packages/plugin`](packages/plugin) | **Plugin source**: local saves, Pinterest browsing + logged-in feed, account page, settings | [English](packages/plugin/README.en.md) · [中文](packages/plugin/README.md) · [contract](packages/plugin/CONTRACT.md) |\n| [`packages/website`](packages/website) | **Website**: static, bilingual, responsive, SEO built in (OG / hreflang / JSON-LD / sitemap) | [website/README.md](packages/website/README.md) |\n| [`docs/`](docs) | README screenshots and static assets | — |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Monorepo layout",
      "text": "```\npinterest-collect/\n├─ packages/\n│  ├─ plugin/        # plugin source\n│  └─ website/       # static marketing site"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install the plugin",
      "text": "The repository root is the installable bundle entry (`package.json` declares `dsh.bundle` / `dsh.client` and exports into `packages/plugin`), so you can install straight from GitHub:\n\n```text\nplugin_manager {\n  action: \"install_bundle\",\n  target: \"github:extrastu/pinterest-collect\"\n}\n\nFor local development the absolute repository path works the same way (do not point at `packages/plugin` — that is the source package and declares no bundle):"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install the plugin",
